            "review_title": "Review at Xuan coffe",
            "review_text": "vuong t\n1 contribution\n1\nThis coffee shop really surprised me the first time I visited. The atmosphere is very cozy, with soft warm lighting and a beauti\nMar 2026 • Friends\nThis coffee shop really surprised me the first time I visited. The atmosphere is very cozy, with soft warm lighting and a beautifully arranged interior that makes the space feel comfortable and relaxing. I ordered a cup of coffee and sat there for quite a while, slowly enjoying my drink while watching people pass by outside. The music in the café is played at just the right volume—pleasant and calming without being distracting. It’s the kind of place where you can work, chat with friends, or simply spend some quiet time for yourself. I would definitely come back here again if I have the chance. ☕✨\nRead more\nWritten March 24, 2026",
